id=tor-relay
name=Tor Bridge + Transparent Proxy
version=v1.1.0
versionCode=2
author=kaandikec
description=Tor 0.4.9.8 bridge node + per-client transparent proxy for ZTE F50. Contributes anonymous bandwidth; optionally routes selected hotspot clients through Tor (TransPort + DNSPort) with leak-blocked UDP. Outbound mode selectable: cellular (direct) or Tailscale-only (VPN kill-switch). Tor runs as 'shell' uid so fwmark routing is precise. Requires bin-utils v1.3.0+.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dikeckaan/magisk-zte-f50-tor-relay/main/update.json
